==History==
2024
*The Bomber's Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 5/2/2024, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/2/2024)|February 2024 Update]].
*On 5/3/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/3/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Bomber's bounce range to 2.5 tiles (from 3 tiles).
*On 14/5/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/5/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the cycles required to 2 (from 1).
*On 8/10/2024, a [[Version History|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Bomber's damage by 2%.
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]], made it so that enemies hit by Evolved Bomber's attack would only take damage once. It also added a sound effect to the Evolved Bomber after death.

