==Trivia==
*The word "''Bomb''" and by extension "''Bomber''" come from the Greek "''bombos''", meaning booming or buzzing, referring to the sound that bombs do when they explode. Bombs were first invented in China during the ninth century. Initially, they were made with ceramic material along with gunpowder, however, they were later changed to cast-iron shells with the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thunder_crash_bomb Thunder crash bomb] during the twelve century.
*The Bomber's Evolution's ability is based on Bomber's Bouncing Bomb ability from Clash of Clans.
*In the Spanish and Finnish language settings of the game, the Bomber's name translates to "Bombardier". In the Russian language settings of the game, the Bomber's name translates to "Demoman".
*The Bomber is 1 of 6 evolved [[cards]] associated with [[Skeletons]], with the others being [[Skeleton Barrel/Evolution|Skeleton Barrel]], [[Witch/Evolution|Witch]], [[Wall Breakers/Evolution|Wall Breakers]], [[Skeleton Army/Evolution|Skeleton Army]], and of course, [[Skeletons/Evolution|Skeletons]].
*The Bomber's Evolution is 1 of 5 cards that has had its [[Card Evolution|Cycles]] required changed, the others being [[Skeletons/Evolution|Skeletons]], [[Ice Spirit/Evolution|Ice Spirit]], [[Baby Dragon/Evolution|Baby Dragon]], and [[Lumberjack/Evolution|Lumberjack]].
*When deployed, the Evolved Bomber exclaims "''Boom!''".
**The Bomber is 1 of 9 evolved [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] that speak distinct words when on the field, the others being [[Wizard/Evolution|Wizard]], [[Goblin Cage/Evolution|Goblin Brawler]], [[Witch/Evolution|Witch]], [[P.E.K.K.A./Evolution|P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Hunter/Evolution|Hunter]], [[Executioner/Evolution|Executioner]], [[Mega Knight/Evolution|Mega Knight]], and Lumberjack.
***Also, the Bomber is 1 of 6 evolved troops whose regular troop do not speak distinct words when on the field, the others being Goblin Brawler, Witch, Hunter, Executioner, and Mega Knight.
*The Bomber's Evolution is the subject of 2 [[Emotes]].
*The Bomber's Evolution was featured in the winning [[Battle Decks|deck]] of the [https://www.youtube.com/live/Sa0QOSJ5AVY?si=Hlcj6efCnFhxfDYe Clash Royale League 2024 Tournament], by a player called Mohamed Light.
*Before the Bomber's Evolution's release, the Evolved Bomber's hitpoints boost was removed.
